{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/c03.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/c03.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "c03_south_01",
      "hash64": "9C85E84B5E08CB1D",
      "text": "你在酿光市玩得还开心吗？\\n这里是科技发达，充满商业来往的城市哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "c03_south_13",
      "hash64": "9C894E4B5E0BAE46",
      "text": "从这里往北就是主街道！\\c\\n被电子公告板围绕的道路\\n是酿光特有的景色哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "c03_south_37",
      "hash64": "9C82624B5E05B194",
      "text": "袜子最重要的就是穿起来舒不舒服！\\n毕竟这是经常穿在身上的东西。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "c03_south_38",
      "hash64": "9C82594B5E05A249",
      "text": "包包最重要的就是要时髦！\\n至于能装多少东西是其次啦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "c03_south_39",
      "hash64": "9C82584B5E05A096",
      "text": "这里就是奇树的道馆……\\n总是在视频里看到这里。好～感动！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "c03_south_43",
      "hash64": "9C935E4B5E141DFB",
      "text": "你有没有看上次的奇树奇述直播？\\n她和莉普合作的那一期好棒哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "c03_south_44",
      "hash64": "9C93634B5E14267A",
      "text": "奇树真的好可爱啊，对吧～！\\n她应该是现在最火的直播主吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "c03_south_56",
      "hash64": "9C96E34B5E1735D1",
      "text": "城镇里有自然景观的话，\\n就能让我历经沧桑的心被治愈呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "c03_south_57",
      "hash64": "9C96E24B5E17341E",
      "text": "住在酿光市，\\n每天感官都会大受刺激是吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "c03_south_85",
      "hash64": "9C6AD44B5DF1E169",
      "text": "好的，高级球是吧！\\c\\n它比超级球还要厉害，\\n我就先下单，订它３００个吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "c03_south_86",
      "hash64": "9C6AD14B5DF1DC50",
      "text": "等我长大后，\\n也要当网～红～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "c03_south_87",
      "hash64": "9C6AD24B5DF1DE03",
      "text": "世界上有\\n各种各样的工作哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "c03_south_127",
      "hash64": "09018B10CDDBBB0A",
      "text": "我本来是要做三明治的，\\n结果手头竟然没有签子……！\\r\\n这类消耗品要多买一些才好哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "c03_south_147",
      "hash64": "09088B10CDE1D9B8",
      "text": "我想吃锦汇镇宝食堂的料理，\\n又觉得玻瓶市海岱俱乐部也挺好……\\r\\n干脆叫飞翔出租车吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "c03_south_148",
      "hash64": "09088A10CDE1D805",
      "text": "过会儿要去捉宝可梦，\\n所以我想吃一些\\r\\n能提升捕获力的料理～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "c03_center_06",
      "hash64": "74451F601B310C00",
      "text": "有宝可梦在海上飞。\\n抓好时机……按快门！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "c03_center_30",
      "hash64": "74421F601B2ED629",
      "text": "这下面有船哦！\\n我好想到海底去看看哦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "c03_center_39",
      "hash64": "744226601B2EE20E",
      "text": "酿光市有非常多的监控摄像头，\\n治安维持得很好哦！\\c\\n听说在酿光道馆的道馆测验中\\n会用上这些监控摄像头拍到的影像呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "c03_center_51",
      "hash64": "745622601B3F844C",
      "text": "在焙固镇体验做陶器！\\n下一份方案就写这个吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "c03_center_65",
      "hash64": "744C2E601B37442B",
      "text": "网络直播也很好啦，\\n但我还是想在现场看宝可梦对战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "c03_center_69",
      "hash64": "744C2A601B373D5F",
      "text": "莱姆在网上发表新歌了耶！\\n得快点听听啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "c03_center_70",
      "hash64": "744FB7601B3A62CD",
      "text": "莉普推出的限定版化妆品，\\n每一款都好棒！不知道要选哪个呢～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "c03_center_73",
      "hash64": "744FB4601B3A5DB4",
      "text": "这楼也太高了吧！\\n看着看着我脖子都酸了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "c03_center_74",
      "hash64": "744FB3601B3A5C01",
      "text": "听说这５栋都是\\n帕底亚不动产的大楼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "c03_center_78",
      "hash64": "744FAF601B3A5535",
      "text": "这座城镇里的电力都是由叫做\\n光蚪仔的宝可梦在努力发电哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "c03_center_79",
      "hash64": "744FAE601B3A5382",
      "text": "我推的人！登上了电子公告牌！\\n我推的人！偶尔会出现！\\r\\n啊啊……寇沙……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "c03_center_90",
      "hash64": "74641B601B4BB5C3",
      "text": "只要是曾经获得过的招式学习器，\\n就可以用招式学习器机制作哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "c03_center_99",
      "hash64": "746422601B4BC1A8",
      "text": "要是有会冲浪的坐骑宝可梦在，\\n就算是跳进海里也没问题哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "c03_center_100",
      "hash64": "CBAABF4E39ACC931",
      "text": "这里以前是港镇，\\n会用船去搬运矿山的矿石。\\c\\n想不到现在竟然变成\\n这～样的商业城市呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "c03_center_110",
      "hash64": "CBA7B94E39AA8928",
      "text": "酿光市的酿光是什么意思呢？\\n酿个精光？酿到发光？\\c\\n既然这里的夜景被誉为百万伏特夜景，\\n那应该就是酿到发光吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "c03_north_21",
      "hash64": "B3085705CEB40C29",
      "text": "不是有个知名的博士吗？\\n[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0101)]她他最近好像都没怎么在媒体上出现耶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "c03_north_22",
      "hash64": "B3085405CEB40710",
      "text": "小匙镇附近有个灯塔，\\n听说那里的１楼是个研究室呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "c03_north_28",
      "hash64": "B3085E05CEB4180E",
      "text": "换个外观的话，\\n心情也会随之改变哦！\\c\\n选择穿什么衣服，\\n也会影响一整天的氛围，对吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "c03_north_40",
      "hash64": "B2F3D205CEA28120",
      "text": "伤药、食材，\\n还有精灵球！\\r\\n没有漏买什么东西吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "c03_north_41",
      "hash64": "B2F3D305CEA282D3",
      "text": "到时候就坐飞翔出租车\\n轻松直达友好商店吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "c03_north_42",
      "hash64": "B2F3D405CEA28486",
      "text": "[EMPTY 44]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "c03_north_71",
      "hash64": "B2FDE305CEAAF288",
      "text": "奇树她从好几年前\\n就开始做网络直播了。\\r\\n……她现在到底几岁啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "c03_north_75",
      "hash64": "B2FDE705CEAAF954",
      "text": "这只勒克猫的毛色\\n是不是超帅的啊～！\\c\\n每次对战后，\\n我都会立马给它洗澡澡呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "c03_north_79",
      "hash64": "B2FDDB05CEAAE4F0",
      "text": "总有一天我要变成有钱人，\\n然后说“从这里到这里，我都要了！”\\r\\n……这句经典台词～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "c03_north_86",
      "hash64": "B31C5805CEC4B6E6",
      "text": "我嚼，我嚼，我嚼嚼嚼。\\c\\n在酿光道馆挑战的实况\\n都会被网络直播哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "c03_north_87",
      "hash64": "B31C5905CEC4B899",
      "text": "我喝，我喝，我喝喝喝。\\c\\n之前的道馆直播里有个叫妮莫的人，\\n她的宝可梦好厉害啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "c03_north_95",
      "hash64": "B31FDB05CEC7CB56",
      "text": "听说在学院里\\n有许许多多的书！\\c\\n等我入学以后，\\n一定要读遍《OH！超自然文化》！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "c03_north_103",
      "hash64": "E28B57DE37061B1A",
      "text": "从这前面的灯塔望下去，\\n可以把酿光市的风景尽收眼底哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "c03_north_106",
      "hash64": "E28B54DE37061601",
      "text": "虽然我也很喜欢风景照，\\n但是会留在回忆里的\\r\\n总是人或宝可梦的照片呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
